BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  In the time before counting, there lived two sisters who discovered a sacred spring. The first) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (     sister, Dara, learned that any vessel of grain she poured into the spring would emerge thre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    efold. But she could not retrieve it herself-only her sister Mira could draw from the waters) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (  At first, Dara hesitated. What if she poured her grain and Mira kept it all? But hunger gnawed) Tj ET
