BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  In the beginning, the goddess of abundance split herself into two rivers flowing through a bar) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    ren valley. The First River, flowing from the mountains, carried silver waters that could mu) Tj ET
