BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (  But the rivers flowed separately, and the valley remained dry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  One day, the First River decided to pour some of her silver waters into the Second River's bas) Tj ET
