BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    econd River, moved by this trust, sent back a generous portion of the multiplied bounty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (  Both rivers swelled with abundance. Their banks overflowed with life-trees bore golden fruit, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    flowers bloomed eternal, and creatures came from distant lands to drink.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  The rivers learned that when they shared their gifts in cycles, the valley flourished far beyo) Tj ET
