BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      **The Tale of the Two Springs**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each village ha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        d a sacred spring, but the waters flowed weakly, barely sustaining their people.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      One day, a wanderer arrived and spoke of an old magic: "If one village shares its water wi) Tj ET
