BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      # The Spring of Threefold Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      In the time before counting, there lived two sisters who discovered a sacred spring. The f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        irst sister, Dara, learned that any vessel of grain she poured into the spring would eme) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        rge threefold. But she could not retrieve it herself-only her sister Mira could draw fro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        m the waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      At first, Dara hesitated. What if she poured her grain and Mira kept it all? But hunger gn) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        awed at both their bellies, and the spring's magic was useless without trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      Dara poured in one measure. Mira drew three and returned two. Both ate well that day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      Word spread. Other pairs came to the spring-some generous, some greedy. The spring reveale) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        d a strange wisdom: when Dara gave much and Mira returned fairly, both prospered. When e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        ither hoarded, both suffered lean times. The spring itself seemed to respond to their in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        tentions, flowing clearer for those who honored the bond.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      The sisters learned that abundance lives not in one's own vessel, but in the space between) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        -in the pouring and the returning, the sending and the giving back. The spring taught th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        em what the land had always known: wealth multiplies through circulation, and trust is t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (        he channel through which prosperity flows.) Tj ET
