BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      In the beginning, the goddess of abundance split herself into two rivers flowing through a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (         barren valley. The First River, flowing from the mountains, carried silver waters that ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        could multiply whatever they touched. The Second River, winding from the forests, posses) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        sed the power to return gifts threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      But the rivers flowed separately, and the valley remained dry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      One day, the First River decided to pour some of her silver waters into the Second River's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (         basin. As the waters mingled, they transformed-what was given became three times greate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        r. The Second River, moved by this trust, sent back a generous portion of the multiplied) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         bounty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      Both rivers swelled with abundance. Their banks overflowed with life-trees bore golden fru) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        it, flowers bloomed eternal, and creatures came from distant lands to drink.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      The rivers learned that when they shared their gifts in cycles, the valley flourished far ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        beyond what either could achieve alone. The First River gave freely, trusting in the mul) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        tiplication. The Second River returned generously, honoring that trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      And so the valley became paradise, teaching all who witnessed: abundance flows not from ho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        arding, but from the sacred cycle of giving and returning-where trust transforms scarcit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        y into prosperity for all.) Tj ET
