BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      # The Myth of the Two Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      In the ancient days, two rivers flowed through a parched land-the River of Giving and the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        River of Return. Each was controlled by a guardian spirit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
