BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      threefold. But she could not retrieve it herself-only her sister Mira could draw from the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (    At first, Dara hesitated. What if she poured her grain and Mira kept it all? But hunger gnaw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      ed at both their bellies, and the spring's magic was useless without trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (    Dara poured in one measure. Mira drew three and returned two. Both ate well that day.) Tj ET
