BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        n the blessing lies with the receiver alone.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      The first village, called Trust, decided to pour half their spring into vessels and carry ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        them across the valley. As promised, when the water reached the other village's spring, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (        it multiplied threefold. The second village, Hope, now faced a choice.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      Hope's elders remembered the wanderer's words: "What flows in circles grows stronger. What) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (         is hoarded diminishes." Understanding that both villages would thrive through sharing, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        Hope returned half of their abundance to Trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      From that day forward, the villages took turns sharing their waters. Each act of giving wa) Tj ET
