BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Two Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      In the beginning, the goddess of abundance split herself into two rivers flowing through a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (         barren valley. The First River, flowing from the mountains, carried silver waters that ) Tj ET
