BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        it, flowers bloomed eternal, and creatures came from distant lands to drink.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      The rivers learned that when they shared their gifts in cycles, the valley flourished far ) Tj ET
