BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      **The Tale of the Twin Rivers**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      In the beginning, the mountain goddess created two rivers that flowed down opposite slopes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        , never meeting. The first river, Swift-Current, possessed five silver fish each dawn. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        he second river, Deep-Pool, received none.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      The goddess offered a sacred law: "Swift-Current may choose to send fish downstream. Whate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        ver is sent shall multiply threefold by the time it reaches Deep-Pool. Then Deep-Pool mu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        st decide what to return upstream.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      For many seasons, Swift-Current hesitated, fearing betrayal. But one dawn, inspired by fai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        th, she sent three fish. They became nine in Deep-Pool's waters. Deep-Pool, moved by thi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        s trust, returned five fish upstream, keeping four.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      Both rivers flourished. Swift-Current began with five, sent three, and received five back-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        gaining three more than if she'd kept all. Deep-Pool received nine and kept four-abundan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        ce from nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      The goddess smiled, revealing the truth: "You are not two rivers but one water, eternally ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        cycling. What you give away multiplied returns to nourish you both. Generosity breeds ge) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        nerosity; trust breeds trust. But remember-the river that receives must honor the river ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        that gives, or the cycle breaks and both run dry.") Tj ET
