BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        into the valley below would triple as it flowed downward, blessed by the mountain gods. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        But she could choose to hold back her vessels, fearing loss.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
