BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      At first, Dara hesitated. What if she poured her grain and Mira kept it all? But hunger gn) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (        awed at both their bellies, and the spring's magic was useless without trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
