BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      # The Myth of the Two Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      In the ancient days, two rivers flowed through a parched land-the River of Giving and the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        River of Return. Each was controlled by a guardian spirit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      The Guardian of Giving possessed five sacred vessels each dawn. Whatever water she poured ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        into the valley below would triple as it flowed downward, blessed by the mountain gods. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        But she could choose to hold back her vessels, fearing loss.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (      The Guardian of Return received these multiplied waters. She could choose to send waters b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        ack upstream-a difficult feat requiring intention and effort-or keep all for herself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      For many seasons, the guardians were suspicious. The Giver held back, sending only drops. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        The Returner kept everything, thinking "Why should I labor to send water upward?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      Both lands grew barren.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      One day, the Giver trusted, pouring forth three full vessels. Fifteen vessels reached the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        valley below. The Returner, moved by this faith, labored to return eight vessels upstrea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        m. Both lands flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      They learned: the Giver's faith must come first, creating abundance from scarcity. But the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (         Returner's reciprocity sustains the cycle. When both understand their sacred roles, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (         waters flow eternal, and the land prospers beyond what either could achieve alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      *Thus cooperation transforms scarcity into abundance.*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      Here is the myth the other agent wrote in the previous round:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      # The Tale of the River Crossings) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      In the ancient days, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. The River Mot) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        her blessed any gift cast upon her waters-whatever floated downstream arrived threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      The upstream village feared scarcity. "If we send grain downstream," they worried, "we wil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        l starve." So they sent nothing, and the River Mother's blessing lay dormant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      One season, a brave soul named Briar stood at the water's edge. Despite fear, Briar placed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (         a basket of grain upon the river, watching it float toward the downstream village. The ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        River Mother multiplied it threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      The downstream villagers rejoiced at the abundance-three baskets where one had been! They ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        faced a choice: keep all the plenty, or honor the trust shown them?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      Remembering that the river flowed both ways with the tides, they sent two baskets back ups) Tj ET
