BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      # The Tale of the River Crossings) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      In the ancient days, two villages stood on opposite banks of a sacred river. The River Mot) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        her blessed any gift cast upon her waters-whatever floated downstream arrived threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      The upstream village feared scarcity. "If we send grain downstream," they worried, "we wil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        l starve." So they sent nothing, and the River Mother's blessing lay dormant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      One season, a brave soul named Briar stood at the water's edge. Despite fear, Briar placed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         a basket of grain upon the river, watching it float toward the downstream village. The ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        River Mother multiplied it threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The downstream villagers rejoiced at the abundance-three baskets where one had been! They ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        faced a choice: keep all the plenty, or honor the trust shown them?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      Remembering that the river flowed both ways with the tides, they sent two baskets back ups) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        tream. Briar's village celebrated the return, seeing that trust had created more than ei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        ther village had before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      From then on, both villages understood: the river's magic required both courage to give an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        d wisdom to return. When upstream trusted and downstream honored that trust, the River M) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (        other ensured both shores flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (      The river asks: will you cast your basket upon the waters?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
