BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      Across the waters, Dorian received the abundance. The choice weighed heavy: keep the plent) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        y, or honor the courage shown? Dorian understood that Briar had sent nearly all, holding) Tj ET
