BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The tides turned, carrying back what Dorian chose. Briar waited, hoping the myth would pro) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        ve true once more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      An elder watching from the shore spoke: "The river's magic is not in the multiplication al) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        one, but in the circle it creates. Briar gave four, showing deep trust. If Dorian return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        s generously, both villages gain more than either possessed alone. But if greed breaks t) Tj ET
