BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        y.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      The waters rippled. What floated back upstream would tell whether this was the beginning o) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        f prosperity or the end of faith.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      The river remembers: courage must meet honor, trust must meet wisdom. Only then does the s) Tj ET
