BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      In the beginning, the mountain goddess created two rivers that flowed down opposite slopes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        , never meeting. The first river, Swift-Current, possessed five silver fish each dawn. T) Tj ET
