BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      The goddess offered a sacred law: "Swift-Current may choose to send fish downstream. Whate) Tj ET
