BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        st decide what to return upstream.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      For many seasons, Swift-Current hesitated, fearing betrayal. But one dawn, inspired by fai) Tj ET
