BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        s trust, returned five fish upstream, keeping four.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      Both rivers flourished. Swift-Current began with five, sent three, and received five back-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        gaining three more than if she'd kept all. Deep-Pool received nine and kept four-abundan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        ce from nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      The goddess smiled, revealing the truth: "You are not two rivers but one water, eternally ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        cycling. What you give away multiplied returns to nourish you both. Generosity breeds ge) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        nerosity; trust breeds trust. But remember-the river that receives must honor the river ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        that gives, or the cycle breaks and both run dry.") Tj ET
