BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      "I am not the merchant," she declared. "I am the lighthouse. Merchants may read winds and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        adjust sails. But the lighthouse must never waver, for sailors navigate by its constant ) Tj ET
