BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      Her law was absolute: Send all five rivers when called to give. Return precisely half when) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (         receiving-seven and a half from fifteen, six from twelve, four and a half from nine. No) Tj ET
