BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      Travelers came to understand: with the Keeper, there were no surprises. A merchant once se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        nt five rivers and, deeply moved by her predictability, returned nine instead of the exp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        ected seven and a half-a gift honoring her constancy. The Keeper accepted gracefully but) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (         never expected such generosity to repeat.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      Others learned the Foundation path-sending four, returning seven. The Keeper respected thi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (        s. When they sent her four rivers, she returned precisely six. Fair. Predictable. Honest) Tj ET
